<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	  Summa is distributed via Developer ID (not the Mac App Store), so the
	  App Sandbox is not required. We intentionally do not opt in because the
	  app needs:
	    - ScreenCaptureKit access to arbitrary on-screen windows
	    - User-chosen export folders preserved across launches (outside a container)
	    - Writes to ~/Library/Application Support/Summa for the training log

	  Hardened runtime is enabled at the build-settings level
	  (ENABLE_HARDENED_RUNTIME=YES). We request no hardened-runtime exceptions:
	  no JIT, no unsigned executable memory, no DYLD environment variables,
	  no disable-library-validation. If we ever need one, add it here with a
	  comment explaining why.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
